Monthly churn in SMB by account age:
— under 6 months: 5.8% (was 5.5% two quarters ago);
— 6–18 months: 3.4% (was 2.9%);
— over 18 months: 1.9% (was 1.8%).

By pricing cohorts:
— old pricing (no increase): 2.9% → 3.7%;
— new pricing: 3.3% → 4.1%.
Both shifted by roughly the same amount, 0.8 percentage points.

By seat count within SMB:
— 1–4 seats: 3.5% → 4.9%;
— 5–19 seats: 2.8% → 2.9%.

