Competitor's free tier launched seven months ago: up to 3 seats, unlimited tickets, no automation.

Cancellation form responses (2.8% response rate, n = 61 over two quarters):
— "Too expensive" — 24;
— "Rarely use it" — 19;
— "Switching to another tool" — 11 (7 of whom explicitly name the competitor);
— "Missing feature" — 4;
— Other — 3.

Sales note on new deals: competitor mentioned in 22% of lost deals.

Legal reminds that expanding the cancellation form with questions requires separate consent.
